#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:1
#: 77b779a8f0f8490a902e4600d136f9dd
msgid "Isomorphic Teleop"
msgstr "同构遥操作"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:3
#: 15e642e27cca4db8ba52ea9da841b998
msgid ""
"Master–slave **isomorphic teleop** (同构遥操作) for **HighTorque Panthera HT**"
" dual-arm: move the master arm in joint space and the slave follows."
msgstr "面向 **高擎 Panthera HT** 双臂的主从 **同构遥操作**：在关节空间移动主臂，从臂跟随。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:5
#: 0728a69140734a149a021e9f367b92ee
msgid ""
"**Implemented:** 同构遥操作 via [`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/drag_teleop_controller) (package name is historical). **Not"
" implemented:** drag teaching (拖动遥操作), trajectory record/playback, or "
"`enter_teach_mode`."
msgstr ""
"**已实现：** 通过 [`drag_teleop_controller`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller) 的同构遥操作（包名是历史遗留）。**未实现：** "
"拖动示教（拖动遥操作）、轨迹录制/回放，或 `enter_teach_mode`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:7
#: e1ac9e40c94146e7a7cb8ebf64024d7c
msgid ""
"On the `panthera-ht` `open-deploy-ws` branch, prefer "
"**`./teleop_start.sh`** (see [HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) and that branch "
"README). The launches below match the `drag_teleop_controller` README."
msgstr ""
"在 `open-deploy-ws` 的 `panthera-ht` 分支上，优先使用 **`./teleop_start.sh`**（见 [高擎"
" Panthera HT](../6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md) 及该分支 "
"README）。下列 launch 与 `drag_teleop_controller` README 一致。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:9
#: ebe9a17705894e18ad95e12d1cdd67d7
msgid ""
"**README:** [drag_teleop_controller README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller/blob/main/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"**README：** [drag_teleop_controller README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/drag_teleop_controller/blob/main/README.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/7-isomorphic_teleop.md:11
